name 'designing-reliable-apps-preassessment-q9_2025'

question 'A developer has an array of 50 song objects fetched from an API and wants to display a card for each one on the page. Which approach best represents the concept of data-driven content?'

wrong 'Write 50 separate blocks of HTML directly in the HTML file, one for each song'
right 'Use a loop to iterate over the array and dynamically generate one card element per song'
wrong 'Paste the raw JSON into a CSS file and use styling rules to display each song on screen'
wrong 'Make 50 separate fetch() calls, one per song, to retrieve each song\'s information individually'

allow_multiple_attempts true

